# Page seed conventions

Read `docs/superpowers/page-build-rules.md` before writing or editing page specs or seed scripts.

## Padding

- **Do not** set `padding_settings` on flexi blocks unless the user explicitly asks for custom spacing.
- Omit the key entirely; use template defaults.

## Heading hierarchy

- **One `h1` per page** — hero block only.
- Major sections: `h2` (`content`, `content_cta`, `team_members` at section level).
- Subsections under a major section: `h3` (e.g. team grid under “Role of the REC”).
- Continue down (`h4`, `h5`) when the source outline requires it — **do not default everything to `h2`**.
- Accordion panel titles are not `heading_tag` fields; put the parent section heading on the `content` block above.

## Helpers

- `require_once __DIR__ . '/lib/page-seed-conventions.php';`
- `matrix_page_seed_heading(2)` for outline-driven tags.
